  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">발명은 창의성을 요구하는 인간의 고유한 영역입니다.<br>AI가 발명을 할 수 있을까요?<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>양초가 탈 때 아래와 같은 문제가 생깁니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e79356515aab28549131baced89aae53786b3dda\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e79356515aab28549131baced89aae53786b3dda\" data-origin-width=\"502\" data-origin-height=\"211\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">1. 양초가 연소할 때 생기는 &#39;터널현상&#39; 에 대해 질문합니다.&#160;</span></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5dcf957c3045b0a4730c1427b211a3f0d81c81e6\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"600\" height=\"332\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5dcf957c3045b0a4730c1427b211a3f0d81c81e6\" data-origin-width=\"962\" data-origin-height=\"533\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">2. &#39;터널현상&#39;을 해결하기 위해 &#39;심지&#39;를 개선하는 아이디어를 질문합니다.</span></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c9e07f8fdb3c55fc8daad76930e3b00c7ada2f5c\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"600\" height=\"277\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c9e07f8fdb3c55fc8daad76930e3b00c7ada2f5c\" data-origin-width=\"996\" data-origin-height=\"459\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160; &#160;<b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">* 심지를 &#39;일자형이 아닌&#39;,&#160; </span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">&#160; &#160; &#160;&#39;나선형 모양&#39;으로 만들어 열을 골고루 전달하는 아이디어(전도현상)를 제안하네요!</span></b></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 82.3447%;\" border=\"1\" data-ke-style=\"style0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 100.0%; text-align: justify;\">이 아이디어는<br>전국학생과학발명품경진대회에 입상한 작품과 유사합니다.<br><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/620cac00a2f5b08a8663bc52da2df241c4e20dbe\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" height=\"182\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/620cac00a2f5b08a8663bc52da2df241c4e20dbe\" data-origin-width=\"635\" data-origin-height=\"231\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ab7a84e3117962c7459558d105203dbad078a24a\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"650\" height=\"377\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ab7a84e3117962c7459558d105203dbad078a24a\" data-origin-width=\"728\" data-origin-height=\"422\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">* 발명 보고서 원문 파일 :</span></b></p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c0358878d5085d7a36965ca62beb19ef1bb70e1?download\" data-file-name=\"스프링 모양의 심지 발명.pdf\" data-file-size=\"4353909\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DevuJ%26dataid%3D278%26fileid%3D11%26regdt%3D20250113103710&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F4c0358878d5085d7a36965ca62beb19ef1bb70e1')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">스프링 모양의 심지 발명</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">4.15MB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">4. 이번에는 한가지 재료인 &#39;철제 거름망&#39;을 제공합니다.</span></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/25deaacba5af54be139f514306d3901f3e79120f\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"650\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/25deaacba5af54be139f514306d3901f3e79120f\" data-origin-width=\"1014\" data-origin-height=\"555\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/15189107b5e46d97e857c4956e636a7d6713f11a\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"650\" height=\"363\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/15189107b5e46d97e857c4956e636a7d6713f11a\" data-origin-width=\"927\" data-origin-height=\"518\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160; &#160; &#160;</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 82.3447%;\" border=\"1\" data-ke-style=\"style0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 100.0%; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b8025a99f1d8a5f94ebacdb9b27611d2e6d61b3b\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"600\" height=\"395\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b8025a99f1d8a5f94ebacdb9b27611d2e6d61b3b\" data-origin-width=\"979\" data-origin-height=\"645\"></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100.0%; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9770e14fed1c5868c07544f49bf7946a297b7a01\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"600\" height=\"203\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9770e14fed1c5868c07544f49bf7946a297b7a01\" data-origin-width=\"932\" data-origin-height=\"315\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">5.&#160; 2번 아이디어 좋네요!</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">이런 제품이 실제로 존재할까요?&#160;</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">전국학생과학발명품경진대회 아이디어를 <br>검색해보니 바로 나오네요!</span></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6bb5282e6caf6842348681f2c3a41243ae71bce5\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"600\" height=\"299\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6bb5282e6caf6842348681f2c3a41243ae71bce5\" data-origin-width=\"1010\" data-origin-height=\"503\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160; <b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\"> * 발명 보고서 원문 파일 : </span></b></p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a07da87dc4e7e26bdf7b4e4830d49dd28d3d40b6?download\" data-file-name=\"터널현상을 줄이는 양초 발명.pdf\" data-file-size=\"1706503\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DevuJ%26dataid%3D278%26fileid%3D12%26regdt%3D20250113103710&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fa07da87dc4e7e26bdf7b4e4830d49dd28d3d40b6')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">터널현상을 줄이는 양초 발명</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.63MB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">AI 활용 소감 :</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">&#160; 창의성이 필요한 영역인 &#39;발명&#39;에서도</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">&#160; 새로운 아이디어를 AI가 만들어 낼 수 있네요!!&#160;</span></b></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
